<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Piper upgrades Varlen.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Piper upgrades Varlen.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Piper Jaffray said it upgraded Varlen Corp to strong buy from buy to reflect improving fundamentals at the company.</p>
<p>-- Raised fiscal year 1998 estimate to $2.30 from $2.25 a share. Set fiscal 1999 estimate at $2.60 and a 12-month price target of $30 on the stock.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 5/8 to 21-3/8.</p>
</text>
